{"id":"a56264a662b79511","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-einstein.md","title":"Einstein","display":"df-einstein — Einstein","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-einstein","aliases":["58-df-einstein"],"display":"df-einstein — Einstein","depends_on":["[[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","[[58-df-ricci-curvature]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-einstein"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-einstein</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-einstein — Einstein"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"58-df-riemannian-manifold\">58-df-riemannian-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b88ba4114f012c8\" href=\"?note=0b88ba4114f012c8\" title=\"58-df-ricci-curvature\">58-df-ricci-curvature</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,g\\in V\">\\(M,g\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"58-df-riemannian-manifold\">58-df-riemannian-manifold</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RicciCurvature}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RicciCurvature}_S\\)</span> (pointwise tangent-bundle Ricci-curvature predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0b88ba4114f012c8\" href=\"?note=0b88ba4114f012c8\" title=\"58-df-ricci-curvature\">58-df-ricci-curvature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Einstein}_S(M,g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Einstein}_S(M,g)\\)</span> (Einstein-metric predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}einstein}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Einstein}_S(M,g)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\rho,R,\\nabla,E,e\\in V\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RicciCurvature}_S(\\rho;R,\\nabla,M,E,g,e,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{32mm}\\land\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall X,Y\\in T_pM\\;\n\\rho_p(X,Y)=\\lambda g_p(X,Y)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}einstein}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Einstein}_S(M,g)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\rho,R,\\nabla,E,e\\in V\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RicciCurvature}_S(\\rho;R,\\nabla,M,E,g,e,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{32mm}\\land\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall X,Y\\in T_pM\\;\n\\rho_p(X,Y)=\\lambda g_p(X,Y)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Einstein metrics have Ricci curvature pointwise proportional to the metric by one global real constant.  The equality is between two covariant <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span>-tensors on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"TM\">\\(TM\\)</span>, not between functions on an arbitrary bundle carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-riemannian-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ricci-curvature","status":"resolved","id":"0b88ba4114f012c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ricci-curvature]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-riemannian-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)$ (see [[58-df-riemannian-manifold]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ricci-curvature","status":"resolved","id":"0b88ba4114f012c8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RicciCurvature}_S$ (pointwise tangent-bundle Ricci-curvature predicate, see [[58-df-ricci-curvature]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,g\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RicciCurvature}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Einstein}_S(M,g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}einstein}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Einstein}_S(M,g)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists\\rho,R,\\nabla,E,e\\in V\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RicciCurvature}_S(\\rho;R,\\nabla,M,E,g,e,n)\\\\\n&\\hspace{32mm}\\land\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall X,Y\\in T_pM\\;\n\\rho_p(X,Y)=\\lambda g_p(X,Y)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"TM","display":false}],"bytes":1228,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-464","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-einstein.md|58-df-einstein]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["04b9f5c6479b7ecd","0b88ba4114f012c8"]}